    <paragraph>For the following exercises, graph the function on a graphing calculator on the window $$x = \left\lbrack {-5,5} \right\rbrack$$ and estimate the horizontal asymptote or limit. Then, calculate the actual horizontal asymptote or limit.</paragraph>
